--- META ---
name: double boundaries
summary: GetFloats keeps float64 extremes intact through the stub
tags: [types, numbers]

--- ENDPOINT ---
types.TypeService/GetFloats

--- REQUEST ---
{
  "name": "floats"
}
// Only the float64 fields are asserted. A float32 reaches the client widened to a
// double over gRPC (3.14 reads as 3.140000104904175) and shortened by protojson
// over grpc-web and Connect (3.14), so no single expectation fits every protocol.

--- ASSERTS ---
.double_pos == 1.7976931348623157e+308
.double_neg == -1.7976931348623157e+308
.double_pi == 3.14159265358979
.double_large == 1e+307
